    {
      "id": "VF01",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "from": "主菜单GlobalVariable数据项",
      "to": "GlobalVariableDialog → 窗口内导入/导出按钮",
      "behavior": "主菜单methodName=GlobalVariable接TitleMenueItemData.GlobalVariable；原方法取GetGlobalVarModule，CheckConfigAvailable为true则返回，空模块时按固定路径加载GlobalVariableModuleCs.dll并选首个IVmModule可赋类型实例化，再取模块。模块非null才new GlobalVariableDialog、DecorateSource=该模块、ShowDialog。导入/导出属于此子窗口动作，绝不是两个顶层主菜单。窗口原BAML底部btnImport/btnExport接BtnImport_Click/BtnExport_Click，远程模式弹出Local/Remote按钮各接独立handler；原generated Connect也保留事件接线。",
