      "id": "VF07",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "from": "BtnExport_Click / ExportGlobalVar",
      "to": "窗口本地导出与远程本地/服务器分流",
      "behavior": "普通导出要求DecorateSource!=null且Items.Count>0；本地SaveFileDialog *.gvar确定后ExportGlobalVar(path)，远程只打开PopExport。Export任务调用varManager.ExportVar，异常提示/日志后return；nRet仍初设0，没有接取SDK返回码。downLoadPath非空时原体FtpDownloadFile(handle,downLoadPath,filePath,true)并File.Exists(downLoadPath)门，成功后FtpRemoveFile(handle,filePath)；按原实参顺序记录，不推断远端真实传输结果。LocalExport先创建固定远程目录，再以远程temp.gvar和本地保存路径调用；RemoteExport选服务器路径直接调用。",
