          "end": 2057,
          "excerpt": "\tprivate void LocalExport_Click(object sender, RoutedEventArgs e)\n\t{\n\t\ttry\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tMicrosoft.Win32.SaveFileDialog saveFileDialog = new Microsoft.Win32.SaveFileDialog();\n\t\t\tsaveFileDialog.Filter = \"*.gvar|*.gvar\";\n\t\t\tsaveFileDialog.FilterIndex = 1;\n\t\t\tsaveFileDialog.RestoreDirectory = true;\n\t\t\tif (saveFileDialog.ShowDialog() == true)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tServerSDKAPI.FtpCreatDir(CVmObjectBase.mhandle, \"/root/vmtempfiles/ftp/ModelFiles/\");\n\t\t\t\tExportGlobalVar(\"/root/vmtempfiles/ftp/ModelFiles/temp.gvar\", saveFileDialog.FileName);\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tcatch (Exception ex)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tHikMessageBox.Show(AppLocalizationService.GetLang(\"导出失败\"));\n\t\t\tLogHelper.objLog.Error(\"全局变量导出失败，ex:\" + ex.ToString());\n\t\t}",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        }
