          "excerpt": "\tprivate void LightSave_Click(object sender, RoutedEventArgs e)\n\t{\n\t\tif (ItemsTotalCount <= 0)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t}\n\t\tif (string.IsNullOrEmpty(VmSolution.Instance.SolutionPath))\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tHikMessageBox.Show(DisplayName + \" \" + AppLocalizationService.GetLang(\"Lang_SaveSuccess\"), MessageIcons.Ok, MessageButtons.NoButton, 1000u);\n\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t}\n\t\ttry\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tServerSDKManager.serverSDKManager.mVmInterfaceManager.LightSaveSolutionEx();\n\t\t\tHikMessageBox.Show(DisplayName + \" \" + AppLocalizationService.GetLang(\"Lang_SaveSuccess\"), MessageIcons.Ok, MessageButtons.NoButton, 1000u);\n\t\t}\n\t\tcatch (VmException ex)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tLogHelper.objLog.Info(\"全局变量保存文件数据失败，错误码为:\" + ex.errorCode);\n\t\t\tHikMessageBox.Show(AppLocalizationService.GetLang(\"保存文件数据失败\"), MessageIcons.Error);\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tprivate void SearchText_TextChanged(object sender, TextChangedEventArgs e)",
